{"caption":"","data":"[Elab.command] [0.578567] ✅️ /-- The original identity roots comparison is the original inverse-image identity. -/\n    theorem rootsPullbackIso_identity (X : Scheme.{u}) (n : ℕ) (hn : 0 < n) (hinv : IsUnit (n : Γ(X, ⊤))) :\n        (rootsPullbackIso (𝟙 X) n hn hinv).hom = (inverseImageId X).hom.app (mu X n) :=\n      by\n      let j := (eqToIso (congrArg (fun f => (inverseImage f).obj (mu X n)) (Category.comp_id (𝟙 X)))).hom\n      have hc := TriangleCoherence.rootsPullbackIso_comp_intrinsic (𝟙 X) (𝟙 X) n hn hinv\n      have hg := TriangleCoherence.rootsPullbackIso_congr (Category.comp_id (𝟙 X)) n hn hinv\n      have hu := congrArg (fun e => e.hom.app (mu X n)) (inverseImageComp_id_comp (𝟙 X))\n      simp only [Iso.trans_hom, NatTrans.comp_app, Functor.isoWhiskerRight_hom, Functor.whiskerRight_app,\n        Functor.leftUnitor_hom_app, eqToIso.hom, eqToHom_app] at hu\n      change\n        (inverseImageComp (𝟙 X) (𝟙 X)).hom.app (mu X n) ≫\n            (inverseImage (𝟙 X)).map ((inverseImageId X).hom.app (mu X n)) ≫ 𝟙 ((inverseImage (𝟙 X)).obj (mu X n)) =\n          j at hu\n      exact\n        Functor.coefficientIso_identity_of_unit_composite (inverseImage (𝟙 X)) (inverseImageId X)\n          (inverseImageComp (𝟙 X) (𝟙 X)) (mu X n) j (rootsPullbackIso (𝟙 X) n hn hinv) (hc.trans hg.symm) hu\n  [Elab.definition.header] [0.577241] ✅️ AlgebraicGeometry.Scheme.EtaleCohomology.Kummer.SectionPullback.rootsPullbackIso_identity\n    [Elab.step] [0.497579] ✅️ expected type: Prop, term\n        IsUnit (n : Γ(X, ⊤))\n      [Elab.app.args] [0.497311] ✅️ elabAppArgs (1 args) `@IsUnit`\n        [Elab.step] [0.459779] ✅️ expected type: ?m.5, term\n            (n : Γ(X, ⊤))\n          [Elab.step] [0.402612] ✅️ expected type: Type u, term\n              Γ(X, ⊤)\n            [Elab.step] [0.227534] 💥️ expected type: Sort ?u.9, term\n                Γ(X, ⊤)\n              [Elab.step] [0.226474] 💥️ expected type: Sort ?u.9, term\n                  (Scheme.Modules.p