{"caption":"","data":"[Elab.command] [0.959708] ✅️ /-- The literal roots coefficient maps contract along the actual section. -/\n    theorem roots_section_coefficients {X Y : Scheme.{u}} (r : Y ⟶ X) (a : X ⟶ Y) (ha : a ≫ r = 𝟙 X) (n : ℕ)\n        (hn : 0 < n) (hinv : IsUnit (n : Γ(X, ⊤))) :\n        (inverseImage a).map (rootsPullbackIso r n hn hinv).hom ≫\n            (rootsPullbackIso a n hn (levelInvertible r n hinv)).hom =\n          (sectionCoefficientIso r a ha (mu X n)).hom :=\n      by\n      let c := inverseImageComp r a\n      let i := eqToIso (congrArg (fun f : X ⟶ X => inverseImage f) ha) ≪≫ inverseImageId X\n      have hc :=\n        Functor.sectionCoefficient_of_composition c i (rootsPullbackIso r n hn hinv)\n          (rootsPullbackIso a n hn (levelInvertible r n hinv)) (rootsPullbackIso (a ≫ r) n hn hinv)\n          (TriangleCoherence.rootsPullbackIso_comp_intrinsic r a n hn hinv) (rootsComposite_identity r a ha n hn hinv)\n      have hi : (Functor.sourceSectionIso c i).hom.app (mu X n) = (sectionCoefficientIso r a ha (mu X n)).hom :=\n        congrArg Iso.hom (sectionCoefficientNatIso_app r a ha (mu X n))\n      exact hc.trans hi\n  [Elab.definition.header] [0.957773] ✅️ AlgebraicGeometry.Scheme.EtaleCohomology.Kummer.SectionPullback.roots_section_coefficients\n    [Elab.step] [0.814455] ✅️ expected type: Prop, term\n        IsUnit (n : Γ(X, ⊤))\n      [Elab.app.args] [0.814110] ✅️ elabAppArgs (1 args) `@IsUnit`\n        [Elab.step] [0.777453] ✅️ expected type: ?m.17, term\n            (n : Γ(X, ⊤))\n          [Elab.step] [0.721394] ✅️ expected type: Type u, term\n              Γ(X, ⊤)\n            [Elab.step] [0.451535] 💥️ expected type: Sort ?u.22, term\n                Γ(X, ⊤)\n              [Elab.step] [0.451095] 💥️ expected type: Sort ?u.22, term\n                  (Scheme.Modules.presheaf✝ X).obj✝ (.op✝ ⊤)\n                [Elab.step] [0.450988] 💥️ expected type: <not-available>, term\n                    (Scheme.Modules.presheaf✝ X)\n                  [Elab.step] [0.450884] 💥️ expected type: <not-available>, term\n                      Scheme.Modules.presheaf✝ X\n                    [Elab.app.args] [0.450323] 💥️ elabAppArgs (1 args) `@Modules.presheaf`\n                      [Elab.coe] [0.448952] 💥️ adding coercion for X : Scheme =?= Modules ?m.19\n                        [Meta.synthInstance] [0.448584] ❌️ CoeT Scheme X (Modules ?m.19)\n                          [Meta.synthInstance.apply] [0.223950] ✅️ apply @AddCommGroupWithOne.toAddCommMonoidWithOne to AddCommMonoidWithOne\n                                (Modules ?m.19)\n                            [Meta.synthInstance.tryResolve] [0.223678] ✅️ AddCommMonoidWithOne\n                                  (Modules ?m.19) ≟ AddCommMonoidWithOne (Modules ?m.19)\n                              [Meta.isDefEq] [0.222952] ✅️ AddCommMonoidWithOne\n                                    (Modules ?m.19) =?= AddCommMonoidWithOne ?m.36\n            [Elab.step] [0.209907] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.22, term\n                Γ(X, ⊤)\n              [Elab.step] [0.209309] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.22, term\n                  (PresheafedSpace.presheaf✝\n                        (SheafedSpace.toPresheafedSpace✝\n                          (LocallyRingedSpace.toSheafedSpace✝ (Scheme.toLocallyRingedSpace✝ X)))).obj✝\n                    (op✝ (α✝ := Scheme.Opens✝ _) ⊤)\n                [Elab.app.args] [0.194086] ✅️ elabAppArgs (1 args) (1 namedArgs) `@Functor.obj`\n                  [Elab.step] [0.175673] ✅️ expected type: (TopologicalSpace.Opens ↥X)ᵒᵖ, term\n                      (op✝ (α✝ := Scheme.Opens✝ _) ⊤)\n                    [Elab.step] [0.175566] ✅️ expected type: (TopologicalSpace.Opens ↥X)ᵒᵖ, term\n                        op✝ (α✝ := Scheme.Opens✝ _) ⊤\n                      [Elab.app.args] [0.175252] ✅️ elabAppArgs (1 args) (1 namedArgs) `@Opposite.op`\n                        [Elab.step] [0.168330] ✅️ expected type: X.Opens, term\n                            ⊤\n          