{"caption":"","data":"[Elab.command] [178.545860] ✅️ /-- Assemble the complete original comparison with arbitrary coefficient\n    sheaves. In particular, the H1/raw-cohomology value correspondence is proved\n    here, before roots, their level or their comparison isomorphisms are supplied. -/\n    private theorem sectionPullback_of_original_coefficients {X Y : Scheme.{u}} (r : Y ⟶ X) (a : X ⟶ Y)\n        (ha : a ≫ r = 𝟙 X) [HasExt.{w} (AbelianSheaf.{u, u + 1} X)] [HasExt.{w'} (AbelianSheaf.{u, u + 1} Y)]\n        {A : AbelianSheaf.{u, u + 1} X} {B : AbelianSheaf.{u, u + 1} Y} (q : (inverseImage r).obj A ≅ B)\n        (s : (inverseImage a).obj B ≅ A) (k : (inverseImage (a ≫ r)).obj A ≅ A)\n        (hcomp : (inverseImageComp r a).hom.app A ≫ (inverseImage a).map q.hom ≫ s.hom = k.hom)\n        (hid : k.hom = (eqToIso (congrArg (fun f : X ⟶ X => inverseImage f) ha) ≪≫ inverseImageId X).hom.app A)\n        (x : H1Etale.{u, u + 1, w'} Y B) :\n        sectionPullback r a ha A (coefficientMap q.inv x) = (Sheaf.H.map s.hom 1).comp (cohomologyPullback a B 1) x :=\n      by\n      let c := inverseImageComp r a\n      let i := eqToIso (congrArg (fun f : X ⟶ X => inverseImage f) ha) ≪≫ inverseImageId X\n      let T := h1Functor.{u, u + 1, w} (X := X)\n      have hφ : (sectionCoefficientIso r a ha A).hom = (Functor.sourceSectionIso c i).hom.app A :=\n        (congrArg Iso.hom (sectionCoefficientNatIso_app r a ha A)).symm\n      have hE :\n        (fun b => sectionPullback r a ha A b) = fun b =>\n          T.map (sectionCoefficientIso r a ha A).hom (h1Pullback a ((inverseImage r).obj A) b) :=\n        rfl\n      have hR :\n        (fun b => (Sheaf.H.map s.hom 1).comp (cohomologyPullback a B 1) b) = fun b => T.map s.hom (h1Pullback a B b) :=\n        by\n        funext b\n        change coefficientMap s.hom (cohomologyPullback a B 1 b) = _\n        rw [cohomologyPullback_one]\n        rfl\n      have hp (b : H1Etale.{u, u + 1, w'} Y B) := h1Pullback_coefficientMap.{u, w', w} a q.inv b\n      have hfinal :=\n        Functor.sectionCoefficient_map_values c i q s k hcomp hid (sectionCoefficientIso r a ha A).hom hφ T\n          (fun b => sectionPullback r a ha A b) (fun b => h1Pullback a ((inverseImage r).obj A) b)\n          (fun b => h1Pullback a B b) (fun b => coefficientMap q.inv b)\n          (fun b => (Sheaf.H.map s.hom 1).comp (cohomologyPullback a B 1) b) hE hR hp\n      exact congrFun hfinal x\n  [Elab.definition.header] [2.939666] ✅️ _private.Aglib.AlgebraicGeometry.EtaleCohomology.Kummer.SectionPullback.0.AlgebraicGeometry.Scheme.EtaleCohomology.Kummer.SectionPullback.sectionPullback_of_original_coefficients\n    [Elab.step] [0.124350] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.49, term\n        (inverseImageComp r a).hom.app A ≫ (inverseImage a).map q.hom ≫ s.hom = k.hom\n      [Elab.step] [0.124216] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.49, term\n          binrel% Eq✝ ((inverseImageComp r a).hom.app A ≫ (inverseImage a).map q.hom ≫ s.hom) k.hom\n        [Elab.step] [0.117155] ✅️ expected type: <not-available>, term\n            CategoryStruct.comp✝ ((inverseImageComp r a).hom.app A) ((inverseImage a).map q.hom ≫ s.hom)\n          [Elab.app.args] [0.116556] ✅️ elabAppArgs (2 args) `@CategoryStruct.comp`\n    [Elab.step] [2.499966] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.95, term\n        sectionPullback r a ha A (coefficientMap q.inv x) = (Sheaf.H.map s.hom 1).comp (cohomologyPullback a B 1) x\n      [Elab.step] [2.499704] ✅️ expected type: Sort ?u.95, term\n          binrel% Eq✝ (sectionPullback r a ha A (coefficientMap q.inv x))\n            ((Sheaf.H.map s.hom 1).comp (cohomologyPullback a B 1) x)\n        [Elab.step] [0.139210] ✅️ expected type: <not-available>, term\n            sectionPullback r a ha A (coefficientMap q.inv x)\n          [Elab.app.args] [0.138611] ✅️ elabAppArgs (5 args) `@sectionPullback`\n        [Elab.step] [2.357473] ✅️ expected type: <not-available>, term\n            (Sheaf.H.map s.hom 1).comp (cohomologyPullback a B 1) x\n          [Elab.step] [