{"caption":"","data":"[Elab.command] [1.851315] ✅️ /--\n    Whole original roots H1 section formula, preserving the actual two independent Ext worlds. -/\n    theorem sectionPullback_roots {X Y : Scheme.{u}} (r : Y ⟶ X) (a : X ⟶ Y) (ha : a ≫ r = 𝟙 X) (n : ℕ) (hn : 0 < n)\n        (hinv : IsUnit (n : Γ(X, ⊤))) [HasExt.{w} (AbelianSheaf.{u, u + 1} X)] [HasExt.{w'} (AbelianSheaf.{u, u + 1} Y)]\n        (x : H1Etale.{u, u + 1, w'} Y (mu Y n)) :\n        sectionPullback r a ha (mu X n) (coefficientMap (rootsPullbackIso r n hn hinv).inv x) =\n          Kummer.rootsCohomologyPullback a n hn (levelInvertible r n hinv) 1 x :=\n      by\n      exact\n        sectionPullback_of_original_coefficients r a ha (rootsPullbackIso r n hn hinv)\n          (rootsPullbackIso a n hn (levelInvertible r n hinv)) (rootsPullbackIso (a ≫ r) n hn hinv)\n          (TriangleCoherence.rootsPullbackIso_comp_intrinsic r a n hn hinv) (rootsComposite_identity r a ha n hn hinv) x\n  [Elab.definition.header] [1.847058] ✅️ AlgebraicGeometry.Scheme.EtaleCohomology.Kummer.SectionPullback.sectionPullback_roots\n    [Elab.step] [0.471813] ✅️ expected type: Prop, term\n        IsUnit (n : Γ(X, ⊤))\n      [Elab.app.args] [0.471493] ✅️ elabAppArgs (1 args) `@IsUnit`\n        [Elab.step] [0.451192] ✅️ expected type: ?m.17, term\n            (n : Γ(X, ⊤))\n          [Elab.step] [0.421782] ✅️ expected type: Type u, term\n              Γ(X, ⊤)\n            [Elab.step] [0.216407] 💥️ expected type: Sort ?u.22, term\n                Γ(X, ⊤)\n              [Elab.step] [0.215977] 💥️ expected type: Sort ?u.22, term\n                  (Scheme.Modules.presheaf✝ X).obj✝ (.op✝ ⊤)\n                [Elab.step] [0.215880] 💥️ expected type: <not-available>, term\n                    (Scheme.Modules.presheaf✝ X)\n                  [Elab.step] [0.215783] 💥️ expected type: <not-available>, term\n                      Scheme.Modules.presheaf✝ X\n                    [Elab.app.args] [0.215245] 💥️ elabAppArgs (1 args) `@Modules.preshe